# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal job-search material. THIS REPO IS PUBLIC.
#
# Added 2026-08-08. The working tree held CVs, cover letters, resumes, company
# research and career tooling as untracked files: a single `git add -A` would
# have published an entire job search. Nothing personal had ever been committed
# (verified against the full history), so this is prevention, not cleanup.
#
# Before removing any line here, ask what a recruiter reading this repo would
# learn that you did not choose to tell them.
